# CPU runtime dependency spec for the Decider candidate container. Resolved ONLY on a GitHub-hosted runner by
# cce-jev-prepare.yml into locks/runtime-cpu.lock.txt (exact versions + sha256 hashes). Never resolved or installed locally.
#
# Upstream decider-ai 1.1.3 declares: torch, transformers>=5, flash-linear-attention, numpy<2, huggingface_hub.
# Deviation (recorded in locks/cpu-runtime.lock.json): flash-linear-attention is excluded from the CPU runtime
# (GPU/triton kernels); the decider wheel is installed --no-deps, its runtime deps are listed here explicitly.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
torch
transformers>=5
numpy<2
huggingface_hub
safetensors
tokenizers
